1
00:00:00,562 --> 00:00:02,732
Oh, so it's like The View.

2
00:00:05,399 --> 00:00:09,569
Sheldon, The View is a daytime
talk show hosted by women.

3
00:00:10,404 --> 00:00:11,774
Oh, I'm aware.

4
00:00:11,773 --> 00:00:13,403
It features Whoopi Goldberg.

5
00:00:13,408 --> 00:00:16,448
She played Guinan on
Star Trek: Next Gen.

6
00:00:16,445 --> 00:00:18,675
Penny, Next Gen
refers to Star Trek...

7
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:19,880
(Penny:)Shut up.

8
00:00:22,016 --> 00:00:24,956
(Raj:)I would like to
propose a salon topic.

9
00:00:24,953 --> 00:00:26,583
(Amy:)Ooh, please do, Rajesh.

10
00:00:26,588 --> 00:00:28,758
The lead in The Hunger
Games is a woman.

11
00:00:28,757 --> 00:00:30,827
(Raj:)Marvel has made
"Tor" a female.

12
00:00:31,626 --> 00:00:32,856
(Penny:)Wait, who's Tor?

13
00:00:32,861 --> 00:00:36,831
(Raj:)You know, Tor,
the God of "Tunder."

14
00:00:37,765 --> 00:00:40,665
(Raj:)As I was saying,
is this a sign

15
00:00:40,669 --> 00:00:43,969
(Raj:)that our society is
approaching gender equality?

16
00:00:43,972 --> 00:00:47,372
(Howard:)Certainly a lot more women
are reading comic books now.

17
00:00:47,376 --> 00:00:48,506
(Stuart:)It's true.

18
00:00:48,510 --> 00:00:52,650
(Stuart:)At the store, I had to put
a seat on the toilet.

19
00:00:52,648 --> 00:00:54,018
(Amy:)We won't know
if there's equality

20
00:00:54,016 --> 00:00:55,886
(Amy:)until female Thor has a baby

21
00:00:55,884 --> 00:01:00,024
(Amy:)and the Avengers are cool with
her pumping breast milk at work.

